/P 540 0 R
/E ("Google Ads is an intent-based, performance-driven advertising ecosystem that operates on a Demand-Capture model. It is designed to target users at the bottom of the marketing funnel by intercepting high-intent search queries in real time. Through an algorithmic auction system balancing bid strategy and Quality Score, it directly addresses explicit user needs at the exact moment of decision-making.")
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
